        "code": {
          "text": "Neurological examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Cranial nerves II–XII grossly intact; visual fields full to confrontation; pupils equal and reactive to light; extraocular movements intact; no nystagmus. Face symmetrical and speech normal, with no dysarthria or aphasia. Motor strength 5/5 in all limbs except left shoulder movement limited by pain and stiffness; no other focal weakness. Light-touch sensation intact. Finger–nose and heel–shin coordination intact. Gait normal, no ataxia."
      }
